      "title": "Software Engineer, New Grad",
      "company_name": "Stripe",
      "first_published": "2026-09-28T10:15:00-04:00",
      "content": "\n&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue and accelerate new business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;What you&#x27;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain APIs, services and systems across Stripe&#x27;s engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Debug production issues across services and multiple levels of the stack&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers across the company to build new features at large scale&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science or a related field, graduating in 2025 or 2026&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience writing production-quality code in Java, Go, Ruby or Python&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A strong grasp of data structures, algorithms and system design fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL databases such as PostgreSQL or MySQL&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems, Kafka or other message queues&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AWS, Docker or Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with React or TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
